# Must trip: a concrete home path (t_3480956c)

TOKENS, on purpose. `__HOME_ROOT__` is substituted with `/Users` or `/home` and
`__OPERATOR_USER__` with any name that is not sanctioned; every indented line below
then becomes an offender. A tracked fixture holding a *contiguous* real-shaped home
path would itself be flagged by the very gate that scans every tracked file — the
anti-vacuity fixture would silently become the offence, and turn the suite red the
day `HOME_PATHS_ENFORCE` flips. So the shape lives here and the value is assembled
by `scripts/tests/test_address_guard.py`.

